# Goal: Run the MediSync Project

This plan outlines the steps to install dependencies and start both the frontend and backend servers for the MediSync project.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend Setup
- Install dependencies in `MediSync-Proyecto`: `npm install`
- Start the development server: `npm run dev`

### Backend Setup
- Install dependencies in `MediSync-Proyecto/backend`: `npm install`
- Start the development server: `npm run dev` (uses nodemon)

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Check if both servers are reachable.
- Frontend usually runs on `http://localhost:5173`.
- Backend port needs to be verified in `server.js`.

### Manual Verification
- Open the browser at the frontend URL.
- Try to interact with the login/registration to see if it communicates with the backend.
